# @hub-lanes

# ── BOX SSH PROBE LANE (BH-7710) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Every 2 minutes the hub ssh's each registry box with a tailnet IP once
# (`ssh root@<ip> true` under timeout) and posts one row per box, with the
# pool's env bundle ssh failures for that IP, to /api/box-ssh. The MCP
# box_health and box_restart tools read it through GET /api/box-health.
# A recorder: it writes no ALERTS line for an unreachable box. flock -n dedupes.
# Off: flags/lane-off-box-ssh-probe, or bin/harness-ctl.sh off box-ssh-probe.
*/2 * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/box-ssh-probe.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
